---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Kirk W.">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Column: Profile Picture and Social Links -->
        <div class="md:col-span-1 flex flex-col items-center text-center scroll-animate">
          <img 
            src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1790887645938839552/Gj2P2n90_400x400.jpg" 
            alt="Profile picture of Kirk W."
            class="rounded-full w-48 h-48 mb-6 shadow-xl border-4 border-primary"
          >
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Kirk W.</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">Innovator | Developer | Creator</p>
          <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mt-2">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kirkw" target="_blank" class="glow-on-hover text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors rounded-full">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/kirkw" target="_blank" class="glow-on-hover text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors rounded-full">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 1.4 3.3 4.4 3.3 4.4s-1.4 1.4-2.8 1.4c-.7 0-1.4-.3-1.4-.3s-1.4 2.8-2.8 2.8c-2.1 0-2.8-2.1-2.8-2.1s-.7 2.1-2.8 2.1c-2.1 0-2.8-2.1-2.8-2.1s-1.4 1.4-2.8 1.4c-1.4 0-2.8-1.4-2.8-1.4s1.7-3 3.3-4.4C3.7 6.1 3 4 3 4s2.1 1.4 3.5 1.4S9.5 4 9.5 4s1.4 2.1 2.8 2.1S15.3 4 15.3 4s1.4 2.1 2.8 2.1S22 4 22 4z"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kirkw/" target="_blank" class="glow-on-hover text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors rounded-full">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Content -->
        <div class="md:col-span-2 scroll-animate">
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-black mb-8">About Me</h1>
          <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-lg text-muted-foreground space-y-6">
            <p>
              I'm a passionate developer and creative technologist with a knack for building beautiful, high-performance web experiences. My work lives at the intersection of design and engineering, where I focus on creating intuitive user interfaces and scalable server-side solutions.
            </p>
            <p>
              With a background in both front-end and back-end development, I have a holistic understanding of the entire development lifecycle. I thrive on turning complex problems into simple, elegant solutions. I'm currently exploring the power of server-first frameworks like Astro.js to build a faster, more efficient web.
            </p>
            <div class="scroll-animate">
              <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold !mt-12 mb-4">My Journey</h3>
              <p>
                From startups to larger engineering teams at tech companies, my career has been a journey of constant learning and innovation. I've had the privilege of working on projects ranging from large-scale consumer applications to cutting-edge AI-powered platforms. Each experience has shaped my approach to technology, reinforcing my belief in user-centric design and agile development.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="scroll-animate">
              <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold !mt-12 mb-4">Beyond the Code</h3>
              <p>
                When I'm not at my keyboard, you can find me exploring the latest in generative art, capturing moments through my camera lens, or experimenting with new recipes in the kitchen. I believe that creativity is a muscle that needs to be exercised in all areas of life, and I'm always looking for new ways to express it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>